Bind Npc 31572 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31571 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 688 "Collecting Mana Pieces I"
    Journal for karus "You must collect Mana pieces with [Senior Researcher] Gaaz."
    Journal for elmorad "You must collect Mana pieces with [Senior Researcher] Aldos."
    Collect 5 of 389480000

Requires player level >= 66 and quest 687 is completed

Rewards
    Give 8750000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    Say "[Chief Researcher] Gaz is starting his research. He wouldn't be able to collect all that by himself. Let's go help him."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here. You should prepare them in advance because it could be a tough work."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Then, please collect [Mana Piece] of the magical creature. \nFirst collect [Unstable Mana Piece] from [Half Troll Shaman]. It has the most disturbing appearance. With that, I should be able to dig into the cause.\n\n[Senior Researcher]Gaz in Eslant has requested to collect a [Unstable Magic Piece] from the [Half-Troll Shaman]."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here. You should prepare them in advance because it can be a tough work."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Then, please collect [Mana Piece] of the magical creature. \nFirst collect [Unstable Mana Piece] from [Half Troll Shaman]. It has the most disturbing appearance. With that, I should be able to dig into the cause.\n\n[Senior Researcher]Aldos in Eslant has requested to collect a [Unstable Magic Piece] from the [Half-Troll Shaman]."

On in_progress
    Say "It's [Unstable Mana Piece] from the [Half Troll Shaman].  You haven't forgotten, right?"

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "It's twisting the flow of manas around as if it's unstable...just like the book said.\n\nThe next [Mana Piece] is [Unstable Mana Piece] of [Death Wizard]. Also called envoy, they suck the vitim's last worldly thought and in doing that, they acculumate impure energy. And recently that energy had an explosive amount of growth. Please hurry."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "It's twisting the flow of manas around as if it's unstable...just like the book said.\n\nThe next [Mana Piece] is [Impure Mana Piece] of [Death Wizard]. Also called envoy, they suck the vitim's last worldly thought and in doing that, they acculumate impure energy. And recently that energy had an explosive amount of growth. Please hurry."

On completed
    Say "Please come back to me when you reach Lv67. You look very weak. You need to be stronger."
